---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import {
  LAUNCH_LIVE,
  LAUNCH_EVENT,
  LAUNCH_EVENT_URL,
  LAUNCH_WHEN,
  SEASONS,
  SUBSCRIBE_CTA,
} from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Base>
  <section class="bg-white hero-glow border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <div class="mb-4">
        <span
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink/15 bg-card px-3 py-1.5 text-xs leading-snug font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-brand-fg"
        >
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-brand inline-block"></span>
          A FOSS United initiative · Launching at{" "}
          <span>
            <a
              href={LAUNCH_EVENT_URL}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              {LAUNCH_EVENT}
            </a>
          </span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h1
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-4 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight"
          >
            Keep Indian open source alive, one rupee at a time
          </h1>
          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/subscribe" class="btn btn-primary px-6 py-3 gap-2">
              <Icon name={LAUNCH_LIVE ? "heart" : "bell"} size={18} />
              {SUBSCRIBE_CTA}
            </a>
            <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-ghost px-6 py-3 gap-2">
              <Icon name="heart" size={18} />
              See projects
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-ink-3">
            <a
              href="https://fossunited.org/grants"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-brand-fg transition-colors duration-150 ease-out rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-fg/50"
            >
              FOSS United's strong history in grantmaking
            </a>
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4">
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value">₹3cr+</div>
              <div class="stat-label">disbursed</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value">27+</div>
              <div class="stat-label">projects</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value">83+</div>
              <div class="stat-label">events</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <p class="text-base text-ink-2 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              Free software isn't free. The Rupee Fund pools small monthly UPI contributions and
              routes them to indie Indian FOSS maintainers.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-ink-2 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Not charity — membership in a commons.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-50 border-b border-brand-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="pillar-title">Small</h2>
          <p class="pillar-body">A student joins on the same terms as a CTO.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="pillar-title">Pooled</h2>
          <p class="pillar-body">No one of us could write a grant this size alone.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="pillar-title">Voted</h2>
          <p class="pillar-body">The people who fund it choose who it funds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-brand-200 pt-6">
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-base text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          Every rupee in this fund comes from someone like <strong class="text-brand-900"
            >you</strong
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-paper">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-5 tracking-tight">How It Works</h2>
          <div class="relative flex-1">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 top-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-ink/15"></span>
            <ol class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="step-badge">
                  <span class="step-number">1</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-0.5">
                  <h3 class="step-title">Subscribe</h3>
                  <p class="step-body">Set up monthly UPI AutoPay from ₹10.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="step-badge">
                  <span class="step-number">2</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-0.5">
                  <h3 class="step-title">Pool Funds</h3>
                  <p class="step-body">Your contributions pool through the season.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="step-badge">
                  <span class="step-number">3</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-0.5">
                  <h3 class="step-title">Vote</h3>
                  <p class="step-body">Contribute 10+ months and help vote on who gets funded.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="step-badge">
                  <span class="step-number">4</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-0.5">
                  <h3 class="step-title">Disburse</h3>
                  <p class="step-body">
                    Funds go to indie FOSS maintainers and builders across India.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-5 tracking-tight">Funding Seasons</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            {
              SEASONS.map((s) => (
                <div
                  class="relative flex flex-col items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-4 text-center shadow-soft transition duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-card"
                  style={`background-image:${s.grad}`}
                >
                  <div class="grid h-16 w-16 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg border border-ink/10 bg-card">
                    <img
                      src={`/seasons/${s.spriteSlug}.svg`}
                      alt=""
                      width="44"
                      height="44"
                      class="h-11 w-11"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <h3 class="text-sm font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">{s.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-3">{s.months}</p>
                  <span
                    class="mt-auto rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white"
                    style={`background-color:${s.accent}`}
                  >
                    {s.duration}
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-5 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>Is the fund live yet?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            Not yet — we open at{" "}
            <a
              href={LAUNCH_EVENT_URL}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              {LAUNCH_WHEN}
            </a>. Leave your email and you'll hear the day contributions open. Nothing is collected
            until then.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>Why this fund?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            Free software can be inexpensive and sustainable when a large pool of users pays for it.
            The minimum is ₹10, which even most students can afford.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>How is this different from FOSS United grants or FLOSS/fund?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            Those are large, foundation- and company-funded grants (₹3cr+ from FOSS United; $1M a
            year from Zerodha's FLOSS/fund). The Rupee Fund is the community layer beneath them.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>Who will be funded?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            Funding based on community voting. Contributors with 10+ months get voting rights for
            each season.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>Will this fund international projects?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            No, but you can fund Indian contributors of international projects.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>Can I donate anonymously?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            No. We comply with all statutory requirements, so anonymous donations are not supported.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq group">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>How are costs handled?</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            Total fund minus administrative overheads equals the funding pool. All costs documented
            transparently.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
